                <zone fixed-size='116' forceUpdate='true' h='15315' id='40' type-v2='text' w='83603' x='15811' y='79477'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#da1e28' fontsize='13'>5 · No protection = higher churn</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#525252' fontsize='11'>Finding</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#525252' fontsize='11'>: 33.4% churn without Online Security or Tech Support, vs 9% with both.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#525252' fontsize='11'>Recommendation</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#525252' fontsize='11'>: Bundle security &amp; support add-ons at a discounted rate.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#525252' fontsize='11'>Expected impact</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#525252' fontsize='11'>: Increases stickiness and lowers churn.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
